  "content": "<p>Возвращает значки здоровья/сердечки HUD к стандартным, ванильным, когда они размещаются поверх других ресурс-паков. Полезно для замены текстур при использовании других ресурс-паков, которые могут ухудшить их внешний вид.</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1423740/description_96382e68-4077-4a3d-b017-3291b2d25ecc.png\" width=\"350\" height=\"350\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1423740/description_edad7c80-50bc-400a-a6d7-da20f4c6793c.png\" width=\"350\" height=\"350\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1423740/description_25e21950-641e-45e9-87b1-3d2ecbada5dd.png\" width=\"350\" height=\"350\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1423740/description_6294a47c-85f5-4e35-8fa4-3698d103b289.png\" width=\"350\" height=\"350\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/vanilla-hunger\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1423740/description_5f293150-29f4-4b17-8ff9-e33d48a1e0dd.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a><br><span style=\"color:#51ade3\"><a style=\"color:#51ade3\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/old-bedrock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Нажмите здесь или на изображение выше, чтобы получить версию с едой/голодом</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Вам также может быть интересно:</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/old-water\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_046f7197-b381-44ca-bc3a-d0da10fd3695.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;font-weight:400;color:#e5e5e5\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/old-bedrock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2c9cb330-cfc0-4c34-9a5c-bf7745f617de.webp\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;font-weight:400;color:#e5e5e5\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/new-bedrock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_8d19c886-7699-4f2a-bdf8-eaebcd8d2dbd.webp\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#51ade3\"><a style=\"color:#51ade3\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/old-water\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Старая вода</a> &nbsp; &nbsp; <a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;font-weight:400;color:#51ade3\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/old-bedrock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Старый Бедрок</a> &nbsp; &nbsp; <a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;font-weight:400;color:#51ade3\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/new-bedrock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Новый Бедрок</a><br></span><br><br><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mute-pistons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1355031/description_d95d6082-b094-4c9d-82ee-b3bb4ef67702.png\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/quieter-pistons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1355031/description_cf1d428e-b393-4de1-80c2-cf3459479226.png\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mute-dispensers-and-droppers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1354464/description_29b2415a-fdfa-44d9-ab13-1460a2fe0fa3.png\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/quieter-dispensers-and-droppers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1354464/description_19500206-d034-4eef-9698-16a7c87cacba.png\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><br><strong><span style=\"color:#51ade3\"><a style=\"color:#51ade3\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mute-pistons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Глушители поршней</a> &nbsp; &nbsp; <a style=\"color:#51ade3\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/quieter-pistons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Более тихие поршни</a> &nbsp; &nbsp; <a style=\"color:#51ade3\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mute-dispensers-and-droppers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Глушители диспенсеров и дропперов</a> &nbsp; &nbsp; <a style=\"color:#51ade3\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/quieter-dispensers-and-droppers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Более тихие диспенсеры и дропперы</a></span></strong></p>",
